an><span begin="00:24.990" end="00:25.380">did </span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:25.470">I </span><span begin="00:25.470" end="00:26.700">die</span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:29.760">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.760" end="00:32.280"><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:30.270">I </span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.630">need </span><span begin="00:30.630" end="00:30.930">to </span><span begin="00:30.930" end="00:32.280">run</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.280" end="00:37.500"><span begin="00:32.280" end="00:32.550">But </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:32.670">I </span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.940">can</span><span begin="00:32.940" end="00:32.970">’</span><span begin="00:32.970" end="00:34.080">t </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.470">get </span><span begin="00:34.470" end="00:34.680">out </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:34.800">of </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.220">bed </span><span begin="00:35.220" end="00:36.000">for </span><span begin="00:36.000" end="00:37.500">anyone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.770" end="00:41.610"><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:38.190">Not </span><span begin="00:38.190" end="00:38.550">for </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:39.390">you</span><span begin="00:39.390" end="00:39.420">,</span><span begin="00:39.420" end="00:41.610">hun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.920" end="01:03.120"><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.280">My </span><span begin="00:59.280" end="01:00.120">sour </span><span begin="01:00.120" end="01:01.620">boy </span><span begin="01:01.620" end="01:01.800">is </span><span begin="01:01.800" end="01:01.890">a </span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:03.120">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.270" end="01:06.570"><span begin="01:03.270" end="01:03.450">I </span><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:03.840">wanna </span><span begin="01:03.840" end="01:04.350">shoot </span><span begin="01:04.350" end="01:04.950">him </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.130">in </span><span begin="01:05.130" end="01:05.460">the </span><span begin="01:05.460" end="01:06.570">brain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.840" end="01:10.860"><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.230">But </span><span begin="01:07.230" end="01:07.530">I</span><span begin="01:07.530" end="01:07.620">’</span><span begin="01:07.620" end="01:07.680">d </span><span begin="01:07.680" end="01:08.160">miss </span><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:08.370">him </span><span begin="01:08.370" end="01:08.760">in </span><span begin="01:08.760" end="01:09.060">the </span><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:10.860">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.530" end="01:15.960"><span begin="01:13.530" end="01:14.100">It </span><span begin="01:14.100" end="01:14.640">really </span><span begin="01:14.640" end="01:15.960">hurts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.990" end="01:20.880"><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.410">When </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.530">I </span><span begin="01:16.530" end="01:17.790">need </span><span begin="01:17.790" end="01:17.970">to </span><span begin="01:17.970" end="01:18.240">so </span><span begin="01:18.240" end="01:18.780">bad </span><span begin="01:18.780" end="01:19.110">but </span><span begin="01:19.110" end="01:19.350">I </span><span begin="01:19.350" end="01:19.710">can</span><span begin="01:19.710" end="01:19.740">’</span><span begin="01:19.740" end="01:19.890">t </span><span begin="01:19.890" end="01:20.070">see </span><span begin="01:20.070" end="01:20.880">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.060" end="01:25.440"><span begin="01:21.060" end="01:21.210">My </span><span begin="01:21.210" end="01:22.590">Juliet</span><span begin="01:22.590" end="01:22.860">, </span><span begin="01:22.860" end="01:22.980">my </span><span begin="01:22.980" end="01:23.700">special </span><span begin="01:23.700" end="01:25.440">girl</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.500" end="01:33.810"><span begin="01:28.500" end="01:28.920">But </span><span begin="01:28.920" end="01:29.190">I </span><span begin="01:29.190" end="01:29.730">need </span><span begin="01:29.730" end="01:30.270">to </span><span begin="01:30.270" end="01:33.810">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.960" end="01:37.200"><span begin="01:33.960" end="01:34.350">When </span><span begin="01:34.350" end="01:34.560">I </span><span begin="01:34.560" end="01:35.760">can </span><span begin="01:35.760" end="01:36.360">power </span><span begin="01:36.360" end="01:37.200">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.470" end="01:40.830"><span begin="01:37.470" end="01:37.710">And </span><span begin="01:37.710" end="01:37.980">when </span><span begin="01:37.980" end="01:38.280">I </span><span begin="01:38.280" end="01:38.700">need </span><span begin="01:38.700" end="01:39.240">some </span><span begin="01:39.240" end="01:39.630">help </span><span begin="01:39.630" end="01:40.230">from </span><span begin="01:40.230" end="01:40.830">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.860" end="01:44.610"><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:41.670">When </span><span begin="01:41.670" end="01:41.820">I </span><span begin="01:41.820" end="01:42.930">should </span><span begin="01:42.930" end="01:43.440">stand </span><span begin="01:43.440" end="01:43.710">my </span><span begin="01:43.710" end="01:44.610">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.760" end="01:48.120"><span begin="01:44.760" end="01:45.030">And </span><span begin="01:45.030" end="01:45.240">when </span><span begin="01:45.240" end="01:45.510">I </span><span begin="01:45.510" end="01:46.020">need </span><span begin="01:46.020" end="01:46.530">to </span><span begin="01:46.530" end="01:46.920">just </span><span begin="01:46.920" end="01:47.430">sit </span><span begin="01:47.430" end="01:48.120">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.270" end="01:51.900"><span begin="01:48.270" end="01:48.990">Sometimes </span><span begin="01:48.990" end="01:49.380">I </span><span begin="01:49.380" end="01:50.340">act </span><span begin="01:50.340" end="01:50.790">like </span><span begin="01:50.790" end="01:51.060">I </span><span begin="01:51.060" end="01:51.900">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.170" end="01:55.890"><span begin="01:52.170" end="01:52.560">But </span><span begin="01:52.560" end="01:52.770">I</span><span begin="01:52.770" end="01:52.800">’</span><span begin="01:52.800" end="01:52.920">m </span><span begin="01:52.920" end="01:53.760">really </span><span begin="01:53.760" end="01:54.420">just </span><span begin="01:54.420" end="01:54.690">a </span><span begin="01:54.690" end="01:55.890">kid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.890" end="01:59.250"><span begin="01:55.890" end="01:56.160">With </span><span begin="01:56.160" end="01:56.520">two </span><span begin="01:56.520" end="01:57.660">corks </span><span begin="01:57.660" end="01:58.050">in </span><span begin="01:58.050" end="01:58.500">his </span><span begin="01:58.500" end="01:59.250">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.550" end="02:04.470"><span begin="01:59.550" end="01:59.880">And </span><span begin="01:59.880" end="02:00.120">a </span><span begin="02:00.120" end="02:01.260">bully </span><span begin="02:01.260" end="02:01.650">in </span><span begin="02:01.650" end="02:02.070">his </span><span begin="02:02.070" end="02:04.470">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.080" end="02:26.430"><span begin="02:19.080" end="02:19.620">I </span><span begin="02:19.620" end="02:20.190">wanna </span><span begin="02:20.190" end="02:21.960">make </span><span begin="02:21.960" end="02:22.050">a </span><span begin="02:22.050" end="02:23.460">colour </span><span begin="02:23.460" end="02:23.670">that </span><span begin="02:23.670" end="02:23.910">no </span><span begin="02:23.910" end="02:24.240">one </span><span begin="02:24.240" end="02:24.660">else </span><span begin="02:24.660" end="02:24.960">has </span><span begin="02:24.960" end="02:25.320">seen </span><span begin="02:25.320" end="02:26.430">before</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.640" end="02:30.540"><span begin="02:26.640" end="02:26.820">I </span><span begin="02:26.820" end="02:27.480">wanna </span><span begin="02:27.480" end="02:28.500">be </span><span begin="02:28.500" end="02:28.860">so </span><span begin="02:28.860" end="02:29.340">much </span><span begin="02:29.340" end="02:30.540">more</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.660" end="02:38.610"><span begin="02:33.660" end="02:34.140">I </span><span begin="02:34.140" end="02:34.470">hope </span><span begin="02:34.470" end="02:34.680">that </span><span begin="02:34.680" end="02:36.180">she </span><span begin="02:36.180" end="02:36.510">looks </span><span begin="02:36.510" end="02:36.660">at </span><span begin="02:36.660" end="02:38.010">me </span><span begin="02:38.010" end="02:38.220">and </span><span begin="02:38.220" end="02:38.610">thinks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.610" end="02:41.670"><span begin="02:38.610" end="02:38.760">“</span><span begin="02:38.760" end="02:39.120">Shit</span><span begin="02:39.120" end="02:39.120">, </span><span begin="02:39.120" end="02:39.420">he</span><span begin="02:39.420" end="02:39.450">’</span><span begin="02:39.450" end="02:39.540">s </span><span begin="02:39.540" end="02:39.840">so </span><span begin="02:39.840" end="02:41.310">pretty</span><span begin="02:41.310" end="02:41.490">”</span><span begin="02:41.490" end="02:41.550">“</span><span begin="02:41.550" end="02:41.640">Shit</span><span begin="02:41.640" end="02:41.670">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.670" end="02:45.480"><span begin="02:41.670" end="02:42.660">Something </span><span begin="02:42.660" end="02:42.900">I </span><span begin="02:42.900" end="02:43.680">can</span><span begin="02:43.680" end="02:43.710">’</span><span begin="02:43.710" end="02:43.800">t </span><span begin="02:43.800" end="02:45.480">believe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.790" end="03:23.010"><span begin="03:17.790" end="03:18.210">But </span><span begin="03:18.210" end="03:18.510">I </span><span begin="03:18.510" end="03:19.020">need </span><span begin="03:19.020" end="03:19.590">to </span><span begin="03:19.590" end="03:23.010">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.040" end="03:26.520"><span begin="03:23.040" end="03:23.700">When </span><span begin="03:23.700" end="03:23.880">I </span><span begin="03:23.880" end="03:25.080">can </span><span begin="03:25.080" end="03:25.680">power </span><span begin="03:25.680" end="03:26.520">through</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.790" end="03:30.120"><span begin="03:26.790" end="03:27.060">And </span><span begin="03:27.060" end="03:27.210">when </span><span begin="03:27.210" end="03:27.540">I </span><span begin="03:27.540" end="03:28.020">need </span><span begin="03:28.020" end="03:28.590">some </span><span begin="03:28.590" end="03:28.980">help </span><span begin="03:28.980" end="03:29.520">from </span><span begin="03:29.520" end="03:30.120">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.480" end="03:37.380"><span begin="03:30.480" end="03:30.930">When </span><span begin="03:30.930" end="03:31.110">I </span><span begin="03:31.110" end="03:32.250">should </span><span begin="03:32.250" end="03:32.760">stand </span><span begin="03:32.760" end="03:33.030">my </span><span begin="03:33.030" end="03:34.050">ground </span><span begin="03:34.050" end="03:34.290">and </span><span begin="03:34.290" end="03:34.560">when </span><span begin="03:34.560" end="03:34.830">I </span><span begin="03:34.830" end="03:35.430">need </span><span begin="03:35.430" end="03:35.790">to </span><span begin="03:35.790" end="03:36.210">just </span><span begin="03:36.210" end="03:36.720">sit </span><span begin="03:36.720" end="03:37.380">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.590" end="03:41.220"><span begin="03:37.590" end="03:38.310">Sometimes </span><span begin="03:38.310" end="03:38.670">I </span><span begin="03:38.670" end="03:39.630">act </span><span begin="03:39.630" end="03:40.110">like </span><span begin="03:40.110" end="03:40.380">I </span><span begin="03:40.380" end="03:41.220">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.460" end="03:45.180"><span begin="03:41.460" end="03:41.880">But </span><span begin="03:41.880" end="03:42.120">I</span><span begin="03:42.120" end="03:42.150">’</span><span begin="03:42.150" end="03:42.240">m </span><span begin="03:42.240" end="03:43.050">really </span><span begin="03:43.050" end="03:43.710">just </span><span begin="03:43.710" end="03:44.010">a </span><span begin="03:44.010" end="03:45.180">kid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.180" end="03:48.570"><span begin="03:45.180" end="03:45.450">With </span><span begin="03:45.450" end="03:45.780">two </span><span begin="03:45.780" end="03:46.950">corks </span><span begin="03:46.950" end="03:47.340">in </span><span begin="03:47.340" end="03:47.820">his </span><span begin="03:47.820" end="03:48.570">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.840" end="03:53.940"><span begin="03:48.840" end="03:49.170">And </span><span begin="03:49.170" end="03:49.410">a </span><span begin="03:49.410" end="03:50.520">bully </span><span begin="03:50.520" end="03:50.940">in </span><span begin="03:50.940" end="03:51.360">his </span><span begin="03:51.360" end="03:53.940">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:59.490" end="04:03.060"><span begin="03:59.490" end="04:00.210">Sometimes </span><span begin="04:00.210" end="04:00.540">I </span><span begin="04:00.540" end="04:01.530">act </span><span begin="04:01.530" end="04:01.980">like </span><span begin="04:01.980" end="04:02.220">I </span><span begin="04:02.220" end="04:03.060">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:03.360" end="04:07.110"><span begin="04:03.360" end="04:03.780">But </span><span begin="04:03.780" end="04:03.960">I</span><span begin="04:03.960" end="04:03.990">’</span><span begin="04:03.990" end="04:04