0" end="04:23.760">in </span><span begin="04:23.760" end="04:24.210">his </span><span begin="04:24.210" end="04:25.080">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:25.290" end="04:30.450"><span begin="04:25.290" end="04:25.650">And </span><span begin="04:25.650" end="04:25.830">a </span><span begin="04:25.830" end="04:26.970">bully </span><span begin="04:26.970" end="04:27.390">in </span><span begin="04:27.390" end="04:27.840">his </span><span begin="04:27.840" end="04:30.450">head</span></p></div></body></tt>